  "subject": {
    "id": "inquisitor-example-role-guard",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Prevent illustrative examples from being classified as conformance fixtures by default.",
  "why": "The self-inquisition guidance correctly keeps Quiet Bell, Neutral Greenhouse, Small Shop, and CYP450 bounded but overgeneralized that role to every future example. This test binds the narrower rule: only a bounded frozen test input, answer key, or scenario is a conformance fixture, and every other example must be classified from its actual purpose."
}
